How many times does `"Hi"` print?

```java
int i = 0;
while (i < 3) {
  System.out.println("Hi");
  i++;
}
```

What is the value of `total` after this code executes?

```java
int total = 0;
int i = 1;
while (i <= 5) {
  total += i;
  i += 2;
}
```

What does the following loop print?

```java
for (int i = 1; i <= 3; i++) {
  System.out.print(i + " ");
}
```

How many total iterations does this loop perform?

```java
for (int i = 10; i > 0; i -= 3) {
  // loop body
}
```

What is the value of `count` after this code runs?

```java
int count = 0;
for (int row = 0; row < 2; row++) {
  for (int col = 0; col < 3; col++) {
    count++;
  }
}
```

How many times does the inner loop's body execute in total?

```java
for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
  for (int j = 0; j < 4; j++) {
    // inner body
  }
}
```

Which best describes the number of times `"*"` is printed, in terms of `n`, for the following code (assume `n` is a positive integer)?

```java
for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
  for (int j = 0; j < n; j++) {
    System.out.print("*");
  }
}
```
